+++- `tests/codemie/configs/test_config.py` — `monkeypatch.setenv(...)` then re-instantiate `Config()`
+++- `tests/codemie_tools/data_management/code_executor/test_models.py` — `patch.dict(os.environ, {}, clear=True)` for fallback case
+++
