+# Configurable Integration URL Defaults Implementation Plan
+
+**Goal:** Make the URL `default` value of every integration `CodeMieToolConfig` overridable per deployment via environment variables, so the UI can pre-fill the correct instance URL without code changes at deploy time. Placeholder text remains a static hint string independent of deployment configuration.
+
+**Architecture:** A single `config_url(config_attr)` utility in `src/codemie_tools/base/models.py` is called at class-definition time inside each model's `Field(...)` call. Its value is baked into field metadata before the LRU-cached `get_available_tools_configs_info()` runs at startup. New `DEFAULT_*_TOOL_URL` fields in `Config(BaseSettings)` are the canonical env-var hooks and the single source of truth for all default values — pydantic-settings reads them automatically from environment or `.env`. There is no second hardcoded fallback string at call sites.
+
+**Tech Stack:** Python 3.12, Pydantic v2, pydantic-settings, pytest, monkeypatch
+
+## Global Constraints
+
+- Call `config_url` at **class-definition time** (i.e., inside the `Field(...)` argument), never lazily, or the LRU cache at startup sees the un-overridden value.
+- The `_TOOL_URL` suffix on every new env var distinguishes them from infrastructure vars (`ELASTIC_URL`, `KUBERNETES_API_URL`, etc.).
+- `default=config_url(...)` is added to ALL tool URL fields (including `RequiredField`-based ones).
+- `json_schema_extra={"placeholder": ...}` always uses a **static string** — never `config_url(...)`. Placeholder is hint text, default is the pre-fill value.
+- `ZephyrConfig.url` was a bare annotation (no `Field`). Changed to `Field(default=config_url(...), ...)` — no longer pydantic-required; app enforces URL presence at runtime.
+- Do not change `ZephyrSquadConfig` (vendor SaaS constant) or `SQLConfig` (host+port, no URL field).
+- Tests: `test_*_default_url_override` naming for env-var override tests; separate placeholder assertions verify the static string.
+
+---
+
+## Task 1: Utility function + Config integration-URL fields
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `src/codemie_tools/base/models.py`
+- Modify: `src/codemie/configs/config.py`
+- Create: `tests/codemie_tools/base/test_config_url.py`
+
+**Interfaces:**
+- Produces: `config_url(config_attr: str) -> str` — importable from `codemie_tools.base.models`
+- Produces: `Config.DEFAULT_JIRA_TOOL_URL`, `Config.DEFAULT_CONFLUENCE_TOOL_URL`, ... (18 fields total)
+
+- [x] **Step 1:** Add `config_url` to `src/codemie_tools/base/models.py`
+- [x] **Step 2:** Add 18 `DEFAULT_*_TOOL_URL` fields to `src/codemie/configs/config.py`
+- [x] **Step 3:** Create `tests/codemie_tools/base/test_config_url.py` with parametrized default + override tests
+- [x] **Step 4:** Commit — `feat(EPMCDME-10928): add config_url utility and DEFAULT_*_TOOL_URL config fields`
+
+---
+
+## Task 2: ZephyrConfig — bare annotation → Field with default and placeholder
+
+**Files:**
+- Modify: `src/codemie_tools/qa/zephyr/models.py`
+- Create: `tests/codemie_tools/qa/zephyr/test_zephyr_models.py`
+
+- [x] **Step 1:** Convert `url: str` to `url: str = Field(default=config_url("DEFAULT_ZEPHYR_TOOL_URL"), description=..., json_schema_extra={"placeholder": "https://api.zephyrscale.smartbear.com/v2"})`
+- [x] **Step 2:** Create tests: `test_zephyr_url_defaults_to_deployment_url`, `test_zephyr_url_placeholder_in_schema`, `test_zephyr_valid_config`
+- [x] **Step 3:** Commit — `feat(EPMCDME-10928): add placeholder to ZephyrConfig.url without changing required semantics`
+
+---
+
+## Task 3: SharePointConfig — new CodeMieToolConfig model
+
+**Files:**
+- Create: `src/codemie_tools/data_management/sharepoint/__init__.py`
+- Create: `src/codemie_tools/data_management/sharepoint/models.py`
