+| `XrayConfig` | `qa/xray/models.py` | `base_url` | `DEFAULT_XRAY_TOOL_URL` |
+| `ZephyrConfig` | `qa/zephyr/models.py` | `url` | `DEFAULT_ZEPHYR_TOOL_URL` |
+| `ServiceNowConfig` | `itsm/servicenow/models.py` | `url` | `DEFAULT_SERVICENOW_TOOL_URL` |
+| `ReportPortalConfig` | `report_portal/models.py` | `url` | `DEFAULT_REPORTPORTAL_TOOL_URL` |
