+| `SharePointConfig` *(new)* | `data_management/sharepoint/models.py` *(new)* | `url` | `DEFAULT_SHAREPOINT_TOOL_URL` |
+
+Three Azure DevOps configs share `DEFAULT_AZURE_DEVOPS_TOOL_URL`; operators set one variable for all three.
+
+---
+
+## Prerequisite changes
+
+### ZephyrConfig — add default and Field metadata
+
+`src/codemie_tools/qa/zephyr/models.py` previously had `url: str` (bare annotation, no `Field`). Changed to `Field(default=config_url(...))` to add both the deployment-configured default and description metadata:
+
+```python
+# Before
+url: str
+
+# After — adds deployment-configurable default and description
+url: str = Field(
+    default=config_url("DEFAULT_ZEPHYR_TOOL_URL"),
+    description="Zephyr Scale API URL",
+    json_schema_extra={"placeholder": "https://api.zephyrscale.smartbear.com/v2"},
+)
+```
+
+Note: this changes the field from pydantic-required to having a default. The app enforces URL presence at runtime.
+
+### SharePointConfig — new model
+
+`SharePointCredentials` (`src/codemie/rest_api/models/settings.py`) is a plain `BaseModel` outside the toolkit hierarchy, so it is not surfaced by `/tools/configs`. Created a new `SharePointConfig(CodeMieToolConfig)` in `src/codemie_tools/data_management/sharepoint/models.py` to add SharePoint to the `/tools/configs` schema surface.
+
+---
+
+## Out of scope
+
+- `ZephyrSquadConfig.DEFAULT_BASE_URL` (`api_wrapper.py`) — vendor SaaS constant, not user-configurable.
+- `SQLConfig` — uses `host + port` pattern, no URL field.
+
+---
+
+## Deployment
+
+`deploy-templates/values.yaml` has one entry per new env var (empty value, filled per deployment):
+
+```yaml
+DEFAULT_JIRA_TOOL_URL: ""
+DEFAULT_CONFLUENCE_TOOL_URL: ""
+# ... all 18 entries
+```
+
+README documents the env vars and their defaults in the "Configuring Tool Default URLs" section.
+
+---
+
+## Testing
+
+Two assertions per integration:
+1. `schema["properties"][field]["default"] == config_url("DEFAULT_X_TOOL_URL")` (or `config.url == config_url(...)` via model instantiation)
+2. `monkeypatch → config_url("DEFAULT_X_TOOL_URL") == override` — tests named `test_*_default_url_override`
+
+Static placeholder assertion: `schema["properties"][field]["placeholder"] == "<static-string>"` — separate from the default.
